#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:304
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJCOORDS\"]/text"
msgstr "RadiKal Sector coordinates get."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:308
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJCOORDS_E\"]/text"
msgstr "Estate/WentworthInnovationsHQ coordinates get."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:312
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJCOORDS_J\"]/text"
msgstr "Jerry/JeromeProtectorate coordinates get."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:316
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJCOORDS_N\"]/text"
msgstr "Nights/RoyalSlug coordinates get."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:322
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJSECTOR\"]/text"
msgstr "opening reroute menu."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:332
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RESET_RK_BOONS\"]/text"
msgstr "DEBUG: Re-locking all RK Judge Boons."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:361
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"So.\" Your new but already dying crew's face is dead serious. \"Since you "
"paid for me... you must be looking for... our special kind of goods, "
"right?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:365
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/text"
msgstr "...Sure, why not?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:367
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"He's clearly struggling to speak. \"Then... make your way there, loaded with all the scr-... Ugh. All the scrap you can find... to fund progress. You'll find your way. M-... my mission is over.\" He hands you some hidden sector's coordinates, then dies.\n"
"\t\t\tYou notice he was already gravely injured and only held on until he could deliver this to somebody, fooling both the store owner and yourself. Some valuable tech in his pocket helps you recoup your losses. \n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\tMaybe you'll find out what that was all about the next time you reroute in hyperspeed..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:377
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Curious dedication, for what looks like nothing more than a black market "
"advert."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:384
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/text"
msgstr "We've already visited the RadiKal Sector. Rest in peace, soldier."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:386
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Progress sha- shall continue... it does bring me comfort... to die among friends... Thank you.\" He dies with a faint smile on his face.\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tAs usual this agent had an incurable disease and volunteered to spread awareness for RK funding and recruit reckless captains, so you're not surprised. You proceed to loot his valuable tech and dispose of the body."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:394
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[@req=\"visited_radikal_sector\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:401
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "What? Of course not. Hold tight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:403
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Don't b- *cough* ... bother, it's too late ... for me... I... ha-... have failed.\" Looking mortified, he crushes a small chip inscribed with a couple capital letters, which briefly but intensely burns. Then he dies.\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tYou proceed to strip the body, notice the swelling and necrosis, and wonder why selling you illegal gear mattered more to that guy more than his impending death. You wonder if the store owner knew and just scammed you.\n"
"\t\t\tAt least there's some valuable tech in the dead soldier's pocket to recoup your losses."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:412
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DJMOD_OPERATIVE_DIES\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"There are surely other ways to revisit this mystery and get to wherever it "
"was going. Moving on."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:478
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"A ship with [style[color:ff3377]]specialized offensive, defensive and intelligence equipment[[/style]] in Elite colors is here.\n"
"\t\tThey must be on high alert judging by how fast they hail you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:486
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "You do not have any removable RadiKal (RK) gear."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:491
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have removable RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.\n"
"\t\t\tRight now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:498
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Take the hail"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:500
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Hello citizens. Do you know anything about the RadiKals?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:503
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Do we know any radicals? I wouldn't say so."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:505
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"That's not quite what I mean. Then allow me to educate you on this matter of public safety.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tRadiKals, also known as 'RK', are a covert group of bad people who do bad things, and incite others do the same by selling them the bad things they made.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tYou look like an upstanding citizen since you don't have anything RadiKal. Yes, we have deep-scanned your ship, twice for good measure.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:512
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Whoa OK, respecting privacy much?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:514
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Don't be a hipster, everybody knows 'privacy' died sometime around the early 21st century. Back to the topic.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe are proudly part of the Anti-RadiKal Secret Service (ARKSS). We wouldn't normally tell you this, but we ne- ... Ahem, we COULD USE more hands, and you look capable.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIf you wish to ensure your own safety, or even join the good fight against them, we sell the right tools that you won't find anywhere else.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBut first, we must check your ship for RK gear. Anything to declare?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:522
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Surrenderable RK gear) We were just wondering how to get rid of this "
"godforsaken stuff, officer!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:528
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:530
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"You take us for fools, but judgement shall be passed on you, despicable Chaos sympathising terrorists. I never could find the ones directly responsible, but at least you will pay for Zeta-708T56-C Secundus's Northern Moonbase!\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:535
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Uh oh..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:537
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"All at once, they power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships), eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support, and a sudden explosion also makes your ears ring.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey must have used some sort of combat augment on your Engines!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThese guys don't mess around. You quickly prepare to fight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:547
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:556
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:558
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Good. Now that you know what we are talking about, do you have any "
"information on RadiKals?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:561
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Nope, but I'd like to see that equipment you mentioned."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:563
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"This gear will make you an RK hunter in no time, or protect you from their devious schemes! Don't let it fall into the wrong hands.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnd if you encounter any of that scum afterwards: do not take their hails, aim for the heads, and 'May Order Prevail'.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:572
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Well, I believe they went that way."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:574
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for your cooperation. Albrecht, perform the jump to the closest beacon and transmit the estimated target coordinates to command! It's gonna take a whole day for our jump drive to recharge.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey immediately throw a reward package through an airlock and cut comms. Hopefully, by some odds there actually are RadiKals that way, or you better hope you never see this ship again."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:584
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Maybe, maybe not, but we're attacking you!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:586
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hmpf! You don't have the gear, but you must be sympathisers. Same scum, different tools. Albrecht?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Ready, sir.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Deploy!\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:591
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Let's do this!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:635
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_INTRO_QUEST_START\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Try to run!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:665
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"A ship with [style[color:ff3377]]specialized offensive, defensive and "
"intelligence equipment[[/style]] is here, apparently on high alert judging "
"by how fast they hail you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:673
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "You do not have any removable RadiKal (RK) gear."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:678
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have removable RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.\n"
"\t\t\tRight now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:685
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Take the hail"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:687
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Citizen, this is the Anti-RadiKal Secret Service. Have you found any "
"RadiKal gear so we can safely dispose of it?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:691
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Surrenderable RK gear) Here's all the disgusting killing stuff we've found,"
" officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:697
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:699
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Wrong answer, scum. And we have everything we need to erase you from this world. The investigation never reached any solid conclusion, but at least YOU will pay for what happened to MY squad!\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:704
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Uh oh..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:706
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"All at once, they power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships), eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support, and a sudden explosion also makes your ears ring.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey must have used some sort of combat augment on your Engines!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThese guys don't mess around. You quickly prepare to fight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:716
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:725
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:727
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Good. Have you seen any RadiKals in this sector?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:730
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "I don't think I have."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:732
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Also good. Now, if you wish to acquire Anti-RK equipment, feel free to gear up. We are the only organization authorized to sell it.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t'May Order Prevail'.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:740
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "They went that way."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:742
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for your cooperation.\" They immediately throw a standard reward"
" package through an airlock and depart. Hopefully, by some odds there "
"actually are RadiKals that way, or you better hope you never see this ship "
"again."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:749
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Maybe, maybe not, but we're attacking you!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:751
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hmpf! You don't have the gear, but you must be sympathisers. Same scum, different tools. Herbert?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Ready, sir.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Deploy!\"\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey power up their weapons and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWhoever they are, these guys don't mess around!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:761
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:805
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_QUEST_START\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Try to run!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:835
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"A ship with [style[color:ff3377]]specialized offensive, defensive and "
"intelligence equipment[[/style]] is here, apparently on high alert judging "
"by how fast they hail you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:843
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "You do not have any removable RadiKal (RK) gear."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:848
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have removable RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.\n"
"\t\t\tRight now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:855
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Take the hail"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:857
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You there. This is Inquisitor Malgro, of the Anti-RadiKal Secret Service. "
"Have you stored any... RadiKal gear for righteous destruction?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:861
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Surrenderable RK gear) Here's all the horrific murder stuff we've found, "
"officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:867
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:869
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Hah! They always think they can get away with it... There is no getting away from justice. I know it's impossible to find any clues about it anymore, but at least you will PAY FOR MY FAMILY YOU SICK FU-!\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:874
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Uh oh..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:876
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"All at once, they power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships), eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support, and a sudden explosion also makes your ears ring.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey must have used some sort of combat augment on your Engines!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThese guys don't mess around. You quickly prepare to fight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:886
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:895
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Nothing to declare, officer."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:897
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Indeed... Where are the RadiKals hiding in this sector?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:900
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "I don't know."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:902
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Yes, right. Nobody ever does... Just remember, the A-RK.S.S. is ever watchful.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWhy don't you prove your innocence by buying some of this exclusive Anti-RK equipment, hmmm?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t'May Order Prevail'\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:911
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Totally, they went that way."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:913
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Is that so? For your sake I hope that's true...\" They immediately throw a"
" standard reward package through an airlock and depart. Hopefully, by some "
"odds there actually are RadiKals that way, or you better hope you never see "
"this ship again."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:920
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Maybe, maybe not, but we're attacking you!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:922
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hmpf! You don't have the gear, but you must be sympathisers. Same scum, different tools. Mordred?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Ready, sir.\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"Deploy!\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:927
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Uh oh..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1042
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER3_QUEST_START\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "...I don't like this one bit. Try to run!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1058
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_INTRO\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As soon as the ship is defeated, your scanners detect multiple micro-charges detonating inside it, ruining most of the salvage. Whatever control freak supervises these guys doesn't leave much to chance.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\tWith the auxiliary ship way out of your range and still firing, you grab some meager scrap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1064
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_INTRO\"]/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"What a punishing fight. Is that the real cost of using RadiKal gear? No "
"matter, take a quick look around, then let's move!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1069
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As soon as the ship is defeated, your scanners detect multiple micro-charges detonating inside it, ruining most of the salvage. Whatever control freak supervises these guys doesn't leave much to chance.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\tWith the auxiliary ship way out of your range and still firing, you grab some meager scrap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1075
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Just the cost of being outlaws. Take a quick look around, then let's move!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1082
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"There is nothing worth taking left.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1086
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[1]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1091
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You notice a weapon that's somehow still intact and bring it onboard.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1096
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[2]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1101
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"You notice a weapon that's somehow still intact and bring it onboard.\n"
"\t\t\tIt's time to jump away from the artillery fire."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1106
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//eventList[@name=\"DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE\"]/event[3]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1117
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You're about to jump away when a cloaked ship suddenly reveals itself. \"Don't worry, we're on thhhhe same side.\"\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\tAs if to prove that, they fire their own long-range weapon at the auxiliary ship, which stops bombarding you from afar.\n"
"\t\tYou can't tell if it's destroyed. In any case, by the time it repairs itself, your business here should be done."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1124
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "If we're on the same side, why wait so long to fire that thing?"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1126
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thhhhis specialized equipment just wasn't charged yet, silly. Do you even "
"know how much Long-Cloaking slows down weapon chhhharge? Anyway, thhhhat was"
" some good fighting right thhhhere! Safe to say I trust you withhh our "
"goods, shhhhould you want some.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1129
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Interesting. Show me the goods."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1131
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Do note thhhhat any other ARKSS ships seeing you with anything tagged \"RK\" will definitely shhhhoot to kill, whichhhh you don't seem to mind.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tJust... don't get hit by thhhhem. One could say thhhhey use hateful equipment without being too far off.\"\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t[Warning: Very limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1138
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1145
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/text"
msgstr "Actually, I want to get more involved. I want to go to the source."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1148
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_NO_COORDS_NO_VISIT_RADIKAL_SECTOR\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Heh! I like your enthhhusiasm. Take thhhhese reroute coordinates to the RadiKal Sector and keep up your whole 'not dying' thhhhing!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tWon't be thhhhat easy, mind you, but it will give you access to the best stuff.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1160
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "We're good, thanks."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1162
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_OUTSIDE_STORE\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Hhhhow disappointing. Still, feel free to kill more ARKSS.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1178
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Show us. Your finder's fee is 15~ per piece.\n"
"\t\tAfterwards we will of course scan you again. If everything is on order, you will be free to go.\"\n"
"\n"
"\t\tTheir equipment may not be capable of detecting RK internal upgrades, but they certainly know about everything else you're carrying.\n"
"\t\tAccording to the documentation they're spamming your screens with, failure to hand over even a single piece is a federal crime!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1190
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_BAM_DIVINE_ARMOR\"]/text"
msgstr "Surrender your Thicker Hull."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1192
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_BAM_DIVINE_ARMOR\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You send them the illegal gear, which they immediately lock up in cargo."

