"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_LASER_BPS\"]/text"
msgstr "Surrender your BPS Messenger laser."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1849
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_LASER_BPS\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You send them the illegal gear, which they immediately lock up in cargo."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1857
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"DJMOD_LASER_BPS\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1864
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/text"
msgstr "(Surrendered RK gear) You know what, we would rather keep the rest!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1866
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The captain looks deeply disappointed in you. \"Did the temptation of unethical power get such a hold of you in so little time? To the point you would just admit criminal intent to the ARKSS's face?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tThey take a moment to reflect. Evidently, things usually go either way from the start, and changes of heart mid-scrutiny like these must be uncommon.\n"
"\t\t\t\tHowever, it seems like an electric shock from their reinforced suit snaps them out of it.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"So, just like that, you have chosen death. Another half-decent ship falls to the dark side. This job is less enjoyable when it's about killing recently-innocent people corrupted by unscrupulous dealers. But we will carry it out. Am I right?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe chorus of their whole crew's well-rehearsed answer is immediate: \"May Order Prevail!\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"Now die, newly-criminal pussycat-eating deviant maniacs!\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tYou don't have time to address the numerous assumptions in these sentences: their weaponry is coming online, and it includes a deployable fire support ship!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1881
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1883
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"A sudden explosion also makes your ears ring. They hit your Engines with a "
"small extra-status payload!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1888
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1890
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"But now, a final explosion is coming from their ship: apparently the gear "
"you surrendered inexplicably just blew up in their hold!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1898
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1904
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"3\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1906
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"3\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"But now, a final explosion is coming from their ship: apparently the gear "
"you surrendered inexplicably just blew up in their hold!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1916
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\"]/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rk_a_outside_police_surrendered_gear\""
" and @lvl=\"3\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1926
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[43]/text"
msgstr "On second thought, we would rather keep it!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1928
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[43]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The captain looks deeply disappointed in you. \"Did the temptation of unethical power get such a hold of you in so little time? To the point you would just admit criminal intent to the ARKSS's face?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThey take a brief moment to reflect. Evidently, things usually go either way from the start, and changes of heart mid-scrutiny like these must be uncommon.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"So, just like that, you have chosen death. Another half-decent ship falls to the dark side. This job is less enjoyable when it takes killing recently-innocent people corrupted by unscrupulous dealers. But we will carry it out. Am I right?\"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe chorus of their whole crew's well-rehearsed answer is immediate: \"May Order Prevail!\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"Now die, newly-criminal kitten-eating deviant!\"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tYou don't have time to address the numerous assumptions in these sentences: their weaponry is coming online, and it includes a deployable fire support ship!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1941
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[43]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1943
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[43]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"A sudden explosion also makes your ears ring. They hit your Engines with a "
"small extra-status payload!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1948
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[43]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1957
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\"]/text"
msgstr "That's all."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1959
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_SURRENDER_GEAR_TO_RK_A\"]/choice[@req=\"RK_HAS_GEAR_SURRENDERABLE_TO_RK_A\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You are relieved to have offloaded the illegal gear to the appropriate authority, instead of having to fight them over it.\n"
"\t\t\t\tHopefully, whatever you have left will be enough.\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"And since you have proven ready to contribute to the security effort, feel free to arm yourself better against this growing threat.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1991
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"Your sensors stop functioning and your view is suddenly obscured, but apparently that's just the doing of a very cautious and well-equipped band of traders. No wonder, with all the shady business going on around here.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1994
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You can't see any shop in the vicinity, but soon a drone from a very well camouflaged ship takes your order.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:1997
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You are quickly scanned and told to stay right here while the owner of a shop that's too far to see arranges remote delivery of your purchases.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2000
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"While you wait at the trading spot, a tiny drone entertains you with an endless feed of funny videos.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2003
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You are forced to leave your ship parked outside while you do your shopping closely escorted inside what looked like a random asteroid.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2006
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"The clerk here is very quiet. Once you install the goods in your ship, as per the deal you wipe recent records so that the merchant's ship appears to have never been here at all.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2009
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_EVENT_STORE_RADIKAL\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"You reluctantly agree to leave your ship in an empty space matrix before they grant you access to the store, and when you exit it, there is no other ship but yours here.\n"
"\t\t\n"
"\t\t[Warning: Limited purchases]"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2019
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Slavers are quite comfortably installed in this sector, in great part due to"
" the lack of regulation. You stumble upon one."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2023
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "See who they might have for sale."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2025
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Feds here? You're surely in need of some muscle, and this might just be "
"your lucky day! We have an elite warrior to do the heavy lifting for you, "
"greatly discounted because we must trade fast and leave for... reasons. What"
" say you?\" You notice that the discount is pretty solid indeed, maybe too "
"good."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2028
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Purchase the elite slave."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2030
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You hand over the scrap to the slavers..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2036
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2043
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2050
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Attack the slavers."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2052
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Slavery is despicable! You prepare for combat, knowing the elite slave will "
"probably not survive it."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2056
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2063
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Ignore them."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2065
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Another ship comes in and buys the slave shortly afterwards. Then it starts going up in flames. Maybe you chose wisely.\n"
"\t\t\tYou have some time to yourself."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2069
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2073
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2099
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_LOSTSUN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"They bring you the slave and remove his restraints, apparently relieved to "
"get rid of him. \"I wasn't stuck in there with them. They were stuck in "
"there with me.\" says the freshly freed troublesome slave. You "
"diplomatically nod and welcome them aboard."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2102
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_LOSTSUN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "I think they'll fit right in."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2107
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_DUSKBRINGER\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"They bring you the slave and remove his restraints, apparently relieved to "
"get rid of him. \"I wasn't stuck in there with them. They were stuck in "
"there with me.\" says the freshly freed troublesome slave. You "
"diplomatically nod and welcome them aboard."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2110
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_DUSKBRINGER\"]/choice/text"
