msgstr "So that's why he was so cheap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2204
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_BADEND_RK_WEAPONLIKE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"They bring you the slave (actually a pair of them) and remove their restraints so quickly that you haven't even transferred all the scrap yet. Unfortunately the troublemakers don't seem to like the way some of your crew look at them, and start blasting! \n"
"\tYou interrupt the scrap transfer and watch the slavers immediately jump away, leaving you to deal with him."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2213
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_BADEND_RK_WEAPONLIKE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "So that's why this was so cheap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2218
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_BADEND_RK_FIREGHOST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"They bring you the slave and remove his restraints so quickly that you haven't even transferred all the scrap yet. Unfortunately the troublemaker doesn't seem to like the way some of your crew look at him, and starts punching! \n"
"\tYou interrupt the scrap transfer and watch the slavers immediately jump away, leaving you to deal with him."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2227
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_BADEND_RK_FIREGHOST\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "So that's why he was so cheap."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2244
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/text"
msgstr "You notice a Theocracy ship nearby, they immediately hail you."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2248
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Take the hail."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2250
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Greetings, pagan. We buy RadiKal weapons, and we believe you have some. We"
" pay even more than their usual buy price.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2253
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "\"Is that so?\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2255
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr "\"...\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2258
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_GEAR_BUYER_ROCKMAN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "\"...\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:2260
msgid ""
